description=v3.6.4 a clean reset: every Recents watcher is gone - the button is the phone's own again and SPSM touches nothing of Quickstep's pipeline - and the frame-rate cap now uses the command verified on this phone (SurfaceFlinger 1035): the whole screen held to 30 while the mode is on, 60 back on exit. RMX3430.
